## The pointer to the Logger

You said "only one part of the program ever creates or holds it." That's the single-owner case, so:

```cpp
// At the one creation site:
std::unique_ptr<Logger> g_logger;   // or a member of the owning component

g_logger = std::make_unique<Logger>("app.log");
```

