## Concurrency note

Your class holds one handle. If only one thread ever calls `log()`, drop the mutex. If more than one might, keep it — but decide this *now*, per the workflow, rather than retrofitting a mutex after a torn-write race appears. Guard the `out_` access, not "the Logger" abstractly.

## Verify before calling it done

